// SilRouteS06 (gfx/SilRouteS06.ron): rose granite (a b c d, 2x2), mossy terrace walls (u v top lip,
// w x face, z Z foot, 2 wide), mossy flagstones p, mossy steps m, bamboo clumps (I J K L) and red maples
// (E F G H) instead of the forest, stone lanterns L, incense burners e, signposts s, the bamboo curtain R,
// the shortcut's mouth P (moved up by 04_reach.ron), the jade dragon altar 1-4. A torii stands at the head
// of each staircase (the stamps below).
